<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico seeks to inject 363 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico seeks to inject 363 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico sought to inject 363 million pesos into the secondary market in a single operation on Wednesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728 9554))</p>
</text>
